# With DECSTBM set, cursor-down is confined to the bottom margin whenever the
# cursor is already inside the region, independent of origin mode. Applications
# reserve a status row this way.
size: 8x6
description: cursor movement stops at the scrolling region's bottom margin

--- input
\e[2;4r\e[3;1H\e[20B

--- expect-cursor
row=3 col=0
